an instrument that transfers an interest in a parcel of land appearing on a filed subdivision plan, or a remnant of land comprised in such a plan, where the instrument refers to the plan by its name and registration data and, in the case of a parcel appearing on a filed subdivision plan, identifies the parcel by its identifying numbers or letters on the plan;

